   System-X 1.07 (eSSeXX) Install archive 
   --------------------------------------

   This archive contains the full install version of the 
   SX (eSSeXX) BBS software and all other needed files to run a
   full AmiExpress styled Bulletin Board System.
   
   System-X is on the run and will be updated permanently !

   ==================================================================

   INSTALL NOTES

   To install this software, use the supported Installer.

   !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!
   The installer does no versioncheck of any systemlibary`s so
   plz check that up.
   !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!

   Follow the instructions by the Installer. You have any time the
   posibility, to abort the installation.
   
   If you like to install by hand, refer to the guide in the SX:Doc/
   directory, chapter `Installation`.
 
   Have a look at the guide and reset your computer.

   Start the System-X BBS in your selected way and be a real \X op :)     
  
   ==================================================================

   Developers Internal Changes
	===========================

	Note(s) on further developing:
	------------------------------
	* To check if a file exists, use the access() function, defined in stdio.h.
  	This funtion basically does the same as: Lock() a file, check if lock!=0,
  	and then UnLock() the file again.

